OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approved on former RAF
OL,4,Abombing site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA solar farm has been approved on land
OL,7,Fwhich used to be used by the RAF to
OL,8,Fpractise bombing in World War Two.
OL,10,FSand Lane Solar Farm, on land east of
OL,11,FKirton Road and west of Manton Village,
OL,12,Fnear Messingham, North Lincolnshire,
OL,13,Fwill have capacity to produce 20.2MW of
OL,14,Felectricity.
OL,16,FA condition of PS Renewables' planning
OL,17,Fpermission for the farm is that the
OL,18,Farea must be checked for unexploded
OL,19,Fbombs before it is built.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
