OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approved on former RAF
OL,4,Abombing site
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, councillors have refused
OL,7,Fplans for another solar farm at Scawby
OL,8,FBrook, near Brigg, on the grounds of
OL,9,Funjustified use of productive
OL,10,Fagricultural land.
